Set Shell "bash"
Set Width 1400
Set Height 900
Set FontSize 14
Set Padding 20
Set TypingSpeed 35ms
Set Framerate 25
Set PlaybackSpeed 1
Set Theme "rose-pine-moon"
Set WindowBar Colorful
Env COLORTERM "truecolor"
Env TERM "xterm-256color"
Output agent-hermes-godot.mp4
Output agent-hermes-godot.gif
Hide
Type "source /workspace/kit/k5_env.sh && cd /workspace/godot && lilbee launch hermes"
Enter
Sleep 95s
Show
Sleep 3s
Type "Use the lilbee search tool: when should I use CharacterBody3D versus RigidBody3D? Cite the class reference."
Sleep 1200ms
Enter
Sleep 75s
Sleep 3s
